<BaseLayout title="The person behind the Creature — Deffy"><article class="inside">
 <PageHeading eyebrow="Beyond the persona" title="There’s a human in here."/>
 <div class="prose"><p>I’m Deffy Pyah Urz, from New Hampshire. A lifelong PC gamer, aspiring streamer, self-taught creator, and someone who keeps asking whether the defaults really have to stay that way.</p>
 <p>Computers, games, and the people on the other side of the screen have been a substantial part of my life. I like making things, but I don’t need every experiment to become useful, profitable, or particularly sensible.</p>
 <p>I care about individuality, autonomy, meaningful relationships, and intellectual honesty. I’m curious about psychology, philosophy, artificial intelligence, and what people could become. I also like taking a ridiculous premise much too far.</p>
 <p>That doesn’t make me consistent. I’ve changed my mind, contradicted myself, and failed to live up to things I value. There’s room for that here, too.</p>
 <h2>The person and the worlds.</h2><p>“The Creature of the Internet” is a persona. Defdef is a character. <a href="/astrizda/">Astrizda</a> is a fictional universe I created. I’m the person behind them, with a life that extends beyond what I make.</p>
